grocery store now trying to reduce the sugar
level, but keeping that sweetness by using

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:45.900
the sweet, sweet baked sweeteners, non-caloric
ones, without us knowing enough about the

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:49.140
science to be really confident in how that's
